      "id": "C01",
      "result": "fixed_unit_verified",
      "change": "Same storage prefix now holds either a sendable full intent or an issue-scoped recovery-only identity. Issue denial erases body/prose, retains original key/target/action/minimal matching identity; both use the same confirmation matcher. Recovery-only records and stale full handles cannot POST. Denied detail mounts GET-only recovery. Account switch/logout clears both.",
