        "stage-schema/code-schema identity matcher parity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C02",
      "result": "fixed_unit_verified",
      "change": "Explicit source workspace in R4 Query keys, metadata-only monotonic generation per QueryClient/Server/viewer/workspace. Exact source denial cancels without rollback and erases private sibling/cross-issue R4 data. Older success/error cannot republish or revoke unrelated issue identity. Already-anonymous R4 identity keeps its original read/error state; fresh authorized reads alone restore private data.",
      "tests": [
        "stage-source-cache.test.ts (3)",
        "stage-code-panel.test.tsx C02 sibling-cache race"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C03",
      "result": "fixed_unit_verified",
      "change": "Current proper-role return derives from coherent R1/R4 identity, separately from source readability/signable approval. Withheld baseline permits reason-only return with null expiry/all-null evidence/no dependencies. Optional hidden references and approval stay refused; withheld-source form contains no evidence pickers.",
      "tests": [
        "stage-code-presentation.test.ts C03",
